    "body": "It refers to the syntax that is accepted when a single string is passed to the constructor (i.e., is accepted by the [constructor string parser](https://urlpattern.spec.whatwg.org/#constructor-string-parsing)), as opposed to the pattern syntax for a single component.\r\n\r\nIt could be renamed something else, but this is how the spec currently refers to that syntax.",
